From e83ec22a20389549fe019c376c721ae582ad9676 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:41:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(ui): edge picks are one edge per click, selected and
 hovered picks read strongly

A plain or Ctrl click took the tangent chain (one edge, two, or a whole
rounded outline by geometry alone); now it takes the edge under the
cursor and only Shift takes the chain/loop. Ctrl+click on an edge a
Shift-taken pick already covers removes it instead of stacking. Selected
picks draw 3 px with a dark halo, list-row hover 5 px; the row's remove
button lights the pick too.

Fixes #1505
Fixes #1507

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
